@@
-Document the split-action button-set pattern using a compact square icon-only trigger, with size-default and per-button override regression coverage.
+Add a per-button `-width-half` modifier inside button sets for split-action triggers with half the standard square width and the full button height. Support group size defaults and per-button size overrides, and document text and icon-only main actions.
*** End Patch

